===Preposition===
{{en-head|prep}}

# Regarding, concerning, [[in regard to]], on the subject of.
#* {{RQ:Bramah Bravo of London|passage="Go on, Uncle Max," said Nora pleasantly. "I like to watch your exceptional mind at work. '''Apropos''' the disappearance of Geoffrey, and that big old lonely house, you were saying—?"}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2011|author=Jeremy Harding|title=Diary|journal=London Review of Books|section=33.VII
|passage=Few have the same root and branch obsession with the recent past or the avenger’s recall (‘the necessity for long memory and sarcasm in argument’, as he wrote '''apropos''' the old left intelligentsia in New York).}}

